RULE LOADED: 020-banking-guardrails

- Do not change fee amounts, tier discounts, the free transfer quota, the list of
  quota-consuming channels, or the settlement cutoff hour. These are product
  decisions. Report the need, do not act on it.
- Do not invent a business rule to make a test pass. If the specification is
  silent, the answer is "ask", not "assume".
- Currency rounding is always `Math.floor` to whole rupiah, matching the ledger.
  Do not switch to `Math.round` to make a number look nicer.
- Any change touching `backend/src/services/feePolicy.js` requires a human
  decision first. Read the TODO(product) note in that file before editing it.
